WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.576
{\an8}Did you access the MAC address
at Phil's terminal?

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.696
{\an8}You were there for ten minutes.

3
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.016
{\an8}The Chinese was slang.

4
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.856
I couldn't translate it.
so I brought another linguist down.

5
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.176
Who was it? Calvin Song.

6
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.336
They have introduced a worm
into the government system.

7
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.416
Tar pits.

8
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.856
The worm jumps inside
and then we trap it.

9
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.016
We've got it. It's trapped.

10
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.656
Saara says you have something.

11
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.696
A long alphanumeric.
Possibly a ciphertext.

12
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.176
We need Vadim Trusov.

13
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.056
We've got an attack coming
out of China at present.

14
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.696
and he holds the key.

15
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.536
Don't worry. we'll get you out.

16
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.376
I've never asked you
for a favour like this.

17
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.856
The PM wants this deal.

18
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.216
He wants nothing less than

19
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.856
resetting China's relationship
with the West.

20
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.976
{\an8}There's something underpinning
the government's lack of support

21
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.216
for our response to the worm attack.

22
00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:44.496
If I were to open these files.
it would doubtless be flagged.

23
00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.520
It's Calvin. he's been found dead.

24
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.074
www  .  OpenSubtitles  .  org

25
00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:48.776
SHARP SNAP Barbara?

26
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.280
CLANGING

27
00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.160
What are you doing?

28
00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:58.480
What's going on?

29
00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.240
Where are the boys?

30
00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:06.920
They're at my mother's.

31
00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:10.600
What the hell's going on. Barbara?

32
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.280
The cleaners...

33
00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:15.880
they took care of Calvin...

34
00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:18.960
and they. um...

35
00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.680
They take care of loose ends.

36
00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.640
Is that what you are. Barbara?

37
00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:29.640
A loose end?

38
00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.440
I saw you...

39
00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.840
in St James's Park.

40
00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.280
You were with Nicky Chan.

41
00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:42.440
Nicky Chan was your old friend
from college. wasn't he?

42
00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.120
Your lover.

43
00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:50.640
You deleted the surveillance reports
on him. didn't you?

44
00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.856
And now he's posing as a legal
counsel to Xiangxin Corporation

45
00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.720
and attending talks
with the Prime Minister.

46
00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.656
Did you give him the MAC address

47
00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.520
for one of our sandbox computers?

48
00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:12.456
Please. just tell me
that I am missing something.

49
00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:17.800
Tell me that you are not the mole.
Barbara. please.

50
00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:23.560
I can't tell you that. Danny.

51
00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.840
I need you to tell me everything.

52
00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.400
Everything?

53
00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:01.040
I need to understand
how you did this...

54
00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.720
how this happened.

55
00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.376
It was easy...

56
00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.776
WHISPERS: What?

57
00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.240
The MAC address. I mean.

58
00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.840
They'd planned the whole thing.

59
00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.520
They'd worked the whole play out.

60
00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:22.336
We need the MAC address
of a sandbox in Malware.

61
00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.760
We launched a ransomware attack
on the NHS.

62
00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.960
It will land in Malware
some time soon.

63
00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.936
It contains some Mandarin text.

64
00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.976
They'll call your department.

65
00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.576
Who was that?

66
00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:35.976
Malware. I'll go.

67
00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.080
I will.

68
00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.656
Find a way to get the engineer
away from the terminal.

69
00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.376
You wouldn't be an angel

70
00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:44.360
and get me a latte from
the coffee van. would you?

71
00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:50.416
When you have the MAC address.
call Calvin Song down.

72
00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.880
Make up some reason.

73
00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.016
Sorry. just too much Chinese slang.

74
00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.520
Calvin. however. is all over it.

75
00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.496
Why Calvin?

76
00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:04.960
The less you know at this stage.
the safer you are.

77
00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.960
Obviously now I know why Calvin.

78
00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:11.960
But that is all I did...

79
00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.696
I swear.

80
00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:15.760
All?

81
00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:20.176
Nicky gave his FSB friends
the MAC address.

82
00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.600
which almost drew us into
a war with Russia.

83
00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.296
In return. they stole the
encrypted key for God knows what

84
00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.216
and gave it to Nicky and the MSS.

85
00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:31.496
Do you have any idea what we've
been dealing with. Barbara?!

86
00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:34.736
Not to mention your colleague.
Calvin.

87
00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:36.336
who looked up to you.

88
00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:37.656
is dead!

89
00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:38.840
I know that!

90
00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.480
Don't you think I know that?!

91
00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:50.096
I am sorry. I'm so sorry...

92
00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.200
Oh. you're sorry? You're sorry?

93
00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.200
What can I say?

94
00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.440
"I'm mortified"?
"I want to die with shame"?

95
00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.760
But none of it will ever be enough.

96
00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:10.760
But how. Barbara?

97
00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:15.480
How?!

98
00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.280
He trapped me.

99
00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.376
He found my weak spot.

100
00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.536
I bet if you looked in your files.

101
00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.720
you'd see me named as a CCP spy
in intercepted messages.

102
00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.120
He played the victim perfectly.

103
00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.040
And if I didn't despise him. I'd...

104
00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.400
I'd almost admire him for it.

105
00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.600
MOUSE CLICKS
I was so sure of myself.

106
00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.360
I was sure that I was doing
the right thing...

107
00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.040
righting historical wrongs...

108
00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:03.856
the tarnishing of
the Chinese people by Britain

109
00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:05.480
for political gains.

110
00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.320
And then it was too late.

111
00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.880
You still could've told me.

112
00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.840
You didn't have to steal
the MAC address.

113
00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.560
I didn't care...

114
00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.400
about losing my job...

115
00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.120
but he knew...

116
00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:36.640
he knew they could never be sure
that you weren't party to it...

117
00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.400
and that you'd lose your job...

118
00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.400
and that would destroy you.

119
00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:45.960
That would destroy both of us.

120
00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.840
I did it to protect you.

121
00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:02.120
It was just this one thing.
I swore that was all I would do.

122
00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:06.960
And then...

123
00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.680
I hoped that it would go away...

124
00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.240
and it did. for a while.

125
00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:18.240
You wanted to protect me?

126
00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:24.640
You had an affair with him
to protect me? No.

127
00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.896
No. I didn't have an affair.
I swear.

128
00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.280
I didn't have an affair.

129
00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.760
Barbara. you've betrayed us all...

130
00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.520
and now you expect me
to believe that?

131
00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.400
No. but...

132
00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.960
that bit's true.

133
00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.360
I love you. Danny.

134
00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.440
The moment you turn yourself in...

135
00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.240
I'm out of GCHQ anyway.

136
00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.360
What was it all for. Barbara?

137
00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.280
I have to hand myself in.

138
00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.880
And maybe I won't be safe...

139
00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.320
but you three will be.

140
00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.320
BARBARA SNIFFLES

141
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.320
And at least this way...

142
00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.920
I can take Nicky down...

143
00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:56.880
blow his cover.

144
00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.600
I have to hand myself in.

145
00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.416
No.

146
00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.216
No. not yet.

147
00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.760
I'm not ready to lose you.

148
00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.976
Maybe Nicky's not
the only one we can take down.

149
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.656
China is his big thing.

150
00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.816
When he was my junior at Trade.

151
00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.960
he was the one that drove through
that nuclear deal...

152
00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:29.976
and you. me. even GCHQ.
we are just a means to that end.

153
00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.360
What do you mean?

154
00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.520
Makinde.

155
00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.760
He's at the heart of this.
I'm sure of it.

156
00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.096
He used Marston as a shield
to keep us away from the deal.

157
00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.816
he knocked us back at every turn -

158
00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.776
Marston as good as admitted it.

159
00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.816
This trade deal was more important
than British lives.

160
00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.600
And Xiangxin are part of it.

161
00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.616
The anti virus software.
the facial recognition.

162
00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:53.936
I did some digging.

163
00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.280
British citizens' biometric data
in the hands of the CCP.

164
00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.960
Mass surveillance. deepfakes.

165
00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.680
But Makinde is behind it.

166
00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:11.040
He did the nuts and bolts
on the China nuclear deal in 2022.

167
00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.880
They must have got to him then.

168
00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.160
But Danny. you've got no proof.

169
00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.440
There is something.

170
00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:28.176
A recording. It's a sound file...
MOUSE CLICKS

171
00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.440
of him negotiating
at the nuclear deal...

172
00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:36.360
but it's Director's
authorisation only.

173
00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.080
I know what I have to do.

174
00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.376
Before they arrest you
and suspend me.

175
00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.176
I'm gonna expose Makinde.

176
00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.416
how he's selling us out to China -

177
00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.440
I'm sure he is...

178
00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.920
and you're gonna help me.

179
00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.800
BEEPING

180
00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:11.656
David is the only person that has
access to the audio file.

181
00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.920
Then we need his ID card and login.

182
00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.376
What time does he get in?

183
00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.456
David doesn't get in till 8.45.

184
00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:20.280
Give yourself enough time
so you can be ready.

185
00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.776
You need to be near
the door when David arrives

186
00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.560
so you can get to him
before he goes in.

187
00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.256
But how do I get his card and login?

188
00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:39.576
I'll tell you.

189
00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:41.760
MUFFLED SPEECH

190
00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.416
Danny?

191
00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.056
The worm's destroyed the trap.

192
00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.536
It's realised it's in a tar pit.

193
00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:49.896
Right. Um...

194
00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:52.640
You're gonna have to
run with this. Roz. Right.

195
00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.056
We'll go through the code again.

196
00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.616
find the expected outcomes
written in.

197
00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:59.336
see if we can modify them
to stop it propagating.

198
00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:01.280
Yeah. You're making all
the right moves.

199
00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.640
I'll inform David when he comes in.

200
00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.336
Saara. did Michaela come through?
Did she get them out?

201
00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.696
They've arranged a boat to pick
them up and take them to Hong Kong.

202
00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:30.176
All right.
And how are they. Vadim and Hai?

203
00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.536
They're OK.

204
00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:32.616
still at the warehouse. safe.

205
00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.840
for the time being.

206
00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:40.136
You need to be near him
when he goes into his office.

207
00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:42.456
You'll need something
like a newspaper or a magazine.

208
00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:43.976
Right on his shoulder.

209
00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.216
Memorise the number.

210
00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.880
You have only got one chance.

211
00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.416
David. the worm's broken out.

212
00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:55.840
You'd best come in. then.

213
00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.856
Vadim Trusov has the key.

214
00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.496
It's a ciphertext -

215
00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.656
an algorithmically produced
alphanumeric string

216
00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.656
stolen from us by the Russians.

217
00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.216
The Chinese launched the worm

218
00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:20.176
to try and find the lock
this key opens.

219
00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:23.216
All to damage printers across
UK government departments?

220
00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.976
Well. it's a distraction.
a deception.

221
00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.336
or a glitch. unfinished code.

222
00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.560
Keeps us guessing.

223
00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:33.376
Why am I only hearing this now?

224
00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:35.216
Well. we thought we had Trusov

225
00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:37.160
but MI6 were beaten to him
by the MSS.

226
00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.376
So we've lost him?

227
00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.656
I asked the Americans to extract him.

228
00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.416
I told them there was
a valuable asset available

229
00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.456
whom we were unable to help.

230
00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:50.200
I'll have to explain that to Alex
and MI6...

231
00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:53.040
not to mention
the Foreign Secretary.

232
00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.416
Well. what about the Prime Minister?

233
00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.136
What about him?

234
00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.856
He's negotiating with the Chinese -

235
00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:01.696
we currently have Chinese wormware
in our Ministry of Defence.

236
00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.800
From what I understand.
the deal's as good as done.

237
00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.576
My bet is he won't want to make
a noise about this

238
00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:08.216
until it's signed and sealed.

239
00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.040
Parliament will have to vote on it.

240
00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:17.376
In fact. what I wanted to say. David.

241
00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:18.800
is that I...

242
00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:23.096
I wanted to apologise
for yesterday.

243
00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.400
asking you to open
the sealed audio file.

244
00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.040
I was in the wrong.

245
00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:30.840
Things have been difficult.

246
00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.000
What. with Barbara?

247
00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:41.456
I just want you to know
that whatever happens.

248
00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.336
I really appreciate your support

249
00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.840
and your friendship.

250
00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.320
Well. thank you. Danny.

251
00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:50.960
Feeling's mutual.

252
00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:56.800
Now. we'd best get on
and get a grip on this worm.

253
00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:14.560
Danny. come and look
at what Saara's found.

254
00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.216
It's a neural network.

255
00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:21.296
AI.

256
00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:22.696
It learns from everything we do.

257
00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:25.496
Any attempt to combat it
just makes it smarter.

258
00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.856
Well. it's gonna take months
to reverse engineer it.

259
00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.896
or even build and train an AI.

260
00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.080
or modify an existing one...

261
00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:35.560
but you know that. so...
So we do build one.

262
00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.816
We use the malware's own code.

263
00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:41.296
We make a replica of the worm
from its own neural network.

264
00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:43.176
but manipulate its concept of time.

265
