00:37:16.520 --> 00:37:19.136
one which I am happy to say
did not succeed.

528
00:37:19.160 --> 00:37:21.576
thanks to the efforts of GCHQ -

529
00:37:21.600 --> 00:37:23.616
yours primarily. I imagine.

530
00:37:23.640 --> 00:37:26.416
I heard the Prime Minister
signed this China deal.

531
00:37:26.440 --> 00:37:27.656
Indeed.

532
00:37:27.680 --> 00:37:30.416
It still needs to be voted on
by Parliament.

533
00:37:30.440 --> 00:37:33.240
but it's widely agreed that it is
a diplomatic triumph.

534
00:37:34.440 --> 00:37:36.936
What about the redacted parts
of the deal.

535
00:37:36.960 --> 00:37:38.080
Parliament won't get to see?

536
00:37:39.200 --> 00:37:41.976
Chinese facial recognition
on the streets of the UK.

537
00:37:42.000 --> 00:37:44.056
Chinese anti-malware software.

538
00:37:44.080 --> 00:37:48.136
Xiangxin are world leaders
in these technologies.

539
00:37:48.160 --> 00:37:50.360
This will help to make
our streets safer.

540
00:37:51.720 --> 00:37:54.400
Is this seriously why you dragged me
all the way up here?

541
00:37:55.760 --> 00:37:58.016
You're in that place because of me.

542
00:37:58.040 --> 00:38:00.136
Now. I have plans -

543
00:38:00.160 --> 00:38:02.520
plans I HAD hoped you'd be a part of.

544
00:38:03.960 --> 00:38:06.256
This is a done deal. so...

545
00:38:06.280 --> 00:38:07.560
"Get with the programme"?

546
00:38:09.320 --> 00:38:11.400
Fine. have it your own way.

547
00:38:12.880 --> 00:38:16.256
I've got the official
farewell banquet to attend.

548
00:38:16.280 --> 00:38:18.400
But Parliament hasn't voted
on it yet.

549
00:38:26.160 --> 00:38:27.816
You'd have to consult
my father-in-law.

550
00:38:27.840 --> 00:38:31.160
but I understand 20 million is
the benchmark for such investments.

551
00:38:34.040 --> 00:38:37.296
My ambition is to see China
once more at its rightful place

552
00:38:37.320 --> 00:38:38.696
as one of the heads of the table.

553
00:38:38.720 --> 00:38:40.560
You are a true friend of
the Chinese people.

554
00:38:42.640 --> 00:38:45.016
Now. what about Richard Marston?

555
00:38:45.040 --> 00:38:46.560
He'll have to be looked after.

556
00:38:49.720 --> 00:38:51.000
Where did you get this?

557
00:38:52.360 --> 00:38:54.696
Danny Patrick. right?
The source is not at issue.

558
00:38:54.720 --> 00:38:56.400
Of course it is.

559
00:38:57.960 --> 00:38:59.336
Roz.

560
00:38:59.360 --> 00:39:00.920
you are being played.

561
00:39:02.000 --> 00:39:03.816
This is obviously a deepfake.

562
00:39:03.840 --> 00:39:05.936
and a pretty crass one at that.

563
00:39:05.960 --> 00:39:10.416
probably laid inside the system
by these same rogue Chinese hackers.

564
00:39:10.440 --> 00:39:11.760
You're smarter than this.

565
00:39:15.560 --> 00:39:16.920
This is how it's done. isn't it?

566
00:39:18.080 --> 00:39:19.176
How what's done?

567
00:39:19.200 --> 00:39:20.936
Whenever confronted
with the uncomfortable truth.

568
00:39:20.960 --> 00:39:22.336
deny. deny. deny.

569
00:39:22.360 --> 00:39:24.576
then turn the story
on the messenger.

570
00:39:24.600 --> 00:39:25.936
You know what?
Think whatever you like.

571
00:39:25.960 --> 00:39:27.096
but I am warning you...

572
00:39:27.120 --> 00:39:30.656
I'm here as a courtesy
to give you a heads-up.

573
00:39:30.680 --> 00:39:32.456
Yes. you have helped me
in my career.

574
00:39:32.480 --> 00:39:34.056
but I do not do your bidding.

575
00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:35.496
I am not "your girl"

576
00:39:35.520 --> 00:39:37.736
and you will not gaslight me.

577
00:39:37.760 --> 00:39:40.576
Roz. think very carefully
before you...

578
00:39:40.600 --> 00:39:42.240
I have thought carefully.

579
00:39:43.400 --> 00:39:45.120
It's not me you need
to put your case to...

580
00:39:46.200 --> 00:39:47.320
it's the public.

581
00:39:48.760 --> 00:39:49.880
What have you done?

582
00:39:51.080 --> 00:39:52.160
Roz!

583
00:39:59.160 --> 00:40:01.376
I'm afraid Nicky Chan
had left the country

584
00:40:01.400 --> 00:40:04.320
by the time you got around
to making your confession.

585
00:40:08.360 --> 00:40:09.480
And as for you...

586
00:40:11.320 --> 00:40:13.920
14 years. I understand.
is the maximum.

587
00:40:15.000 --> 00:40:17.320
With no previous
and an understanding judge...

588
00:40:18.480 --> 00:40:21.320
I imagine may consider
a single-figure sentence.

589
00:40:22.520 --> 00:40:24.520
With good behaviour.
five years maybe.

590
00:40:26.640 --> 00:40:28.120
I hope it was worth it.

591
00:40:30.880 --> 00:40:32.400
Such great hopes for you. Barbara.

592
00:40:34.920 --> 00:40:36.360
Cut to the chase.

593
00:40:37.960 --> 00:40:39.720
It's just all so...

594
00:40:41.600 --> 00:40:42.920
middling.

595
00:40:44.880 --> 00:40:46.120
Piss off. Alex.

596
00:40:55.640 --> 00:40:57.336
Five years.

597
00:40:57.360 --> 00:40:58.880
What age will. um...

598
00:41:00.040 --> 00:41:01.040
Elliot be?

599
00:41:02.320 --> 00:41:03.480
20?

600
00:41:04.880 --> 00:41:05.880
And. uh...

601
00:41:06.960 --> 00:41:08.376
Fabian? 17?

602
00:41:08.400 --> 00:41:10.240
I mean. you won't miss everything.
I suppose.

603
00:41:11.400 --> 00:41:13.120
Did you really just come here
to gloat?

604
00:41:21.040 --> 00:41:22.536
I came here

605
00:41:22.560 --> 00:41:24.000
to make you an offer.

606
00:41:26.040 --> 00:41:27.896
I'm offering you a way out -

607
00:41:27.920 --> 00:41:30.176
a way to save yourself.
your husband. even.

608
00:41:30.200 --> 00:41:32.240
though I'm not sure about
your marriage.

609
00:41:33.600 --> 00:41:35.160
You never were. Hmm.

610
00:41:37.080 --> 00:41:39.240
And possibly a chance
to repay Mr Chan.

611
00:41:41.320 --> 00:41:44.096
Now. the only people who know
what you've done so far

612
00:41:44.120 --> 00:41:47.896
are Danny. Charlie Francis.
perhaps some of his team.

613
00:41:47.920 --> 00:41:50.280
David Neal and myself.

614
00:41:52.280 --> 00:41:53.480
What if we kept it that way?

615
00:41:55.800 --> 00:41:58.960
What if everything carried on
as normal and you go back to work?

616
00:42:04.760 --> 00:42:06.480
You want me to be a double agent.

617
00:42:08.760 --> 00:42:09.960
Back working for me...

618
00:42:11.600 --> 00:42:12.760
like the good old days.

619
00:42:14.760 --> 00:42:16.880
They think
they have something on you.

620
00:42:17.880 --> 00:42:18.976
That's useful.

621
00:42:19.000 --> 00:42:20.160
What do you say?

622
00:42:33.400 --> 00:42:36.640
All charges against your wife.
Barbara Napier. have been dropped.

623
00:42:39.960 --> 00:42:41.056
How?

624
00:42:41.080 --> 00:42:43.296
Any enquiries into your actions
as her accomplice

625
00:42:43.320 --> 00:42:44.640
are therefore dropped.

626
00:42:47.360 --> 00:42:48.640
What's going on. Charlie?

627
00:42:50.520 --> 00:42:52.680
You'll have to ask someone else
about that.

628
00:42:55.280 --> 00:42:57.480
So. am I free to go?

629
00:43:01.760 --> 00:43:03.536
Regarding your other actions.

630
00:43:03.560 --> 00:43:05.336
Daniel Patrick.
you are to be detained

631
00:43:05.360 --> 00:43:08.776
for breaches of
the 1989 Official Secrets Act.

632
00:43:08.800 --> 00:43:13.480
namely the theft and distribution
of STRAP 3 confidential material.

633
00:43:15.240 --> 00:43:17.200
Leave him. for Christ's sake.

634
00:43:18.600 --> 00:43:19.960
Let him walk out.

635
00:43:35.120 --> 00:43:36.520
Ready?

636
00:43:38.640 --> 00:43:39.720
Yeah.

637
00:43:50.800 --> 00:43:52.136
Don't worry.

638
00:43:52.160 --> 00:43:53.800
it was the right thing to do.

639
00:43:55.480 --> 00:43:58.200
And remember. I'm a scrappy bastard.

640
00:44:16.320 --> 00:44:19.336
Today. the Prime Minister
and the Foreign Secretary

641
00:44:19.360 --> 00:44:22.856
stand accused of what
one senior official called.

642
00:44:22.880 --> 00:44:25.336
"At best. a grave conflict
of interest.

643
00:44:25.360 --> 00:44:28.576
"and at worst.
accepting what appears to be"

644
00:44:28.600 --> 00:44:30.896
"a bribe from Chinese officials"

645
00:44:30.920 --> 00:44:34.176
"in return for political access
and influence."

646
00:44:34.200 --> 00:44:36.176
In secret recordings.

647
00:44:36.200 --> 00:44:40.816
the Prime Minister allegedly demands
a £20 million investment

648
00:44:40.840 --> 00:44:44.696
into his father-in-law's
Shanghai-based hedge fund.

649
00:44:44.720 --> 00:44:47.136
He also suggests that. quote.

650
00:44:47.160 --> 00:44:50.576
"Richard Marston
will need to be looked after."

651
00:44:50.600 --> 00:44:52.576
Now. the Prime Minister.
Andrew Makinde.

652
00:44:52.600 --> 00:44:54.136
hasn't been seen yet.

653
00:44:54.160 --> 00:44:55.696
but within the last few hours.

654
00:44:55.720 --> 00:44:58.176
a Downing Street spokesperson said.

655
00:44:58.200 --> 00:45:00.536
"The recordings are fake."

656
00:45:00.560 --> 00:45:03.936
"but I can tell you that tonight's
banquet with the Chinese delegation"

657
00:45:03.960 --> 00:45:06.256
"has now been cancelled."

658
00:45:06.280 --> 00:45:10.176
And with opposition leaders calling
for immediate resignations.

659
00:45:10.200 --> 00:45:13.816
intelligence agencies
reportedly investigating the breach

660
00:45:13.840 --> 00:45:16.936
and public outrage mounting.

661
00:45:16.960 --> 00:45:20.400
the demand for answers is only
likely to get louder.

662
00:45:22.440 --> 00:45:24.736
MUFFLED YELLING
The GCHQ whistle-blower

663
00:45:24.760 --> 00:45:26.736
who brought down the Government.

664
00:45:26.760 --> 00:45:29.296
allegedly an unnamed senior manager.

665
00:45:29.320 --> 00:45:32.176
has. according to sources.

666
00:45:32.200 --> 00:45:34.856
been released without charge.

667
00:45:34.880 --> 00:45:38.456
It is not yet clear
why no charges were brought.

668
00:45:38.480 --> 00:45:41.096
What is clear is that espionage.

669
00:45:41.120 --> 00:45:43.776
once seen as the stuff
of the Cold War.

670
00:45:43.800 --> 00:45:46.560
is now firmly back
on the public agenda.

671
